Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.13,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,0)\c&HA89176&\t(2100,2100,\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&)}我也絕不退場
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.13,0:01:15.47,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)\c&HF9DFBD&\1a&H37&\t(1300,1300,\c&HDEE6D3&)\t(2540,2540,\c&HF9DFBD&)}縱使心口刺痛 我仍要高聲宣揚
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.60,0:01:21.06,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&}我春日裡遇見你
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.06,0:01:25.48,OP_CH,,0,0,0,,{\1a&H4B&\t(1000,1400,\c&H5F4743&\1a&H00&)}為你的夏日風情 心馳神往
